{
  "title": "Energie live",
  "views": [
    {
      "title": "Energie",
      "path": "energie",
      "icon": "mdi:lightning-bolt",
      "type": "panel",
      "cards": [
        {
          "type": "vertical-stack",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "entities",
              "title": "Aktuell",
              "show_header_toggle": false,
              "entities": [
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.awattar_full_price_gross_estimated",
                  "name": "Bezugspreis inkl. Aufschläge"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.sungrow_battery_level",
                  "name": "Hausbatterie"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.sungrow_load_power",
                  "name": "Hausverbrauch"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.sungrow_pv_power",
                  "name": "PV-Leistung"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "custom:apexcharts-card",
              "header": {
                "show": true,
                "title": "Strompreis · verfügbare kommende Stunden",
                "show_states": false
              },
              "graph_span": "36h",
              "span": {
                "start": "hour"
              },
              "now": {
                "show": true,
                "label": "Jetzt"
              },
              "yaxis": [
                {
                  "decimals": 1,
                  "apex_config": {
                    "title": {
                      "text": "ct/kWh"
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "series": [
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.awattar_marketdata_raw",
                  "name": "Bezug inkl. Aufschläge",
                  "unit": "ct/kWh",
                  "float_precision": 2,
                  "type": "line",
                  "curve": "stepline",
                  "stroke_width": 3,
                  "color": "#d28b08",
                  "extend_to": false,
                  "data_generator": "const rows=(entity.attributes.data||[]).filter(r=>Number.isFinite(r.start_timestamp)&&Number.isFinite(r.end_timestamp)&&Number.isFinite(r.marketprice)&&r.end_timestamp>r.start_timestamp).sort((a,b)=>a.start_timestamp-b.start_timestamp); return rows.flatMap(r=>[[r.start_timestamp,r.marketprice*0.12+11.96],[r.end_timestamp-1,r.marketprice*0.12+11.96],[r.end_timestamp,null]]);"
                }
              ],
              "apex_config": {
                "chart": {
                  "height": 300
                },
                "tooltip": {
                  "x": {
                    "format": "dd.MM. HH:mm"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "custom:apexcharts-card",
              "header": {
                "show": true,
                "title": "Leistung und Batterie-SoC · letzte 24 Stunden"
              },
              "graph_span": "24h",
              "yaxis": [
                {
                  "id": "power",
                  "min": 0,
                  "decimals": 1,
                  "apex_config": {
                    "title": {
                      "text": "Leistung · kW"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "soc",
                  "opposite": true,
                  "min": 0,
                  "max": 100,
                  "decimals": 0,
                  "apex_config": {
                    "title": {
                      "text": "SoC · %"
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "series": [
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.sungrow_pv_power",
                  "name": "PV",
                  "color": "#e6a817",
                  "yaxis_id": "power",
                  "unit": "kW",
                  "transform": "return x === null ? null : x / 1000;",
                  "float_precision": 2,
                  "stroke_width": 2,
                  "extend_to": false,
                  "group_by": {
                    "func": "avg",
                    "duration": "5min",
                    "fill": "null"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.sungrow_load_power",
                  "name": "Hausverbrauch",
                  "color": "#147d75",
                  "yaxis_id": "power",
                  "unit": "kW",
                  "transform": "return x === null ? null : x / 1000;",
                  "float_precision": 2,
                  "stroke_width": 2,
                  "extend_to": false,
                  "group_by": {
                    "func": "avg",
                    "duration": "5min",
                    "fill": "null"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.sungrow_grid_import_power",
                  "name": "Netzbezug",
                  "color": "#d65a4a",
                  "yaxis_id": "power",
                  "unit": "kW",
                  "transform": "return x === null ? null : x / 1000;",
                  "float_precision": 2,
                  "stroke_width": 2,
                  "extend_to": false,
                  "group_by": {
                    "func": "avg",
                    "duration": "5min",
                    "fill": "null"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.sungrow_grid_export_power",
                  "name": "Einspeisung",
                  "color": "#7c66b5",
                  "yaxis_id": "power",
                  "unit": "kW",
                  "transform": "return x === null ? null : x / 1000;",
                  "float_precision": 2,
                  "stroke_width": 2,
                  "extend_to": false,
                  "group_by": {
                    "func": "avg",
                    "duration": "5min",
                    "fill": "null"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.sungrow_battery_charge_power",
                  "name": "Batterie lädt",
                  "color": "#65a657",
                  "yaxis_id": "power",
                  "unit": "kW",
                  "transform": "return x === null ? null : x / 1000;",
                  "float_precision": 2,
                  "stroke_width": 2,
                  "extend_to": false,
                  "group_by": {
                    "func": "avg",
                    "duration": "5min",
                    "fill": "null"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.sungrow_battery_discharge_power",
                  "name": "Batterie entlädt",
                  "color": "#c38638",
                  "yaxis_id": "power",
                  "unit": "kW",
                  "transform": "return x === null ? null : x / 1000;",
                  "float_precision": 2,
                  "stroke_width": 2,
                  "extend_to": false,
                  "group_by": {
                    "func": "avg",
                    "duration": "5min",
                    "fill": "null"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.sungrow_battery_level",
                  "name": "Batterie-SoC",
                  "unit": "%",
                  "yaxis_id": "soc",
                  "color": "#3267c8",
                  "stroke_width": 3,
                  "extend_to": false,
                  "group_by": {
                    "func": "last",
                    "duration": "5min",
                    "fill": "null"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "apex_config": {
                "chart": {
                  "height": 390
                },
                "tooltip": {
                  "x": {
                    "format": "dd.MM. HH:mm"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "Preise aus aWATTar: Börsenpreis × 1,20 + 0,1196 EUR/kWh. Nur veröffentlichte Stunden werden gezeigt. Keine separate Tado-Preisquelle angebunden. Leistung links in kW, Batterie-SoC rechts in %. Die Leistungskurven zeigen 5-Minuten-Mittelwerte; SoC den letzten Wert je Intervall. Über die Legende lassen sich Kurven ausblenden. [PV- und Ladeplaner öffnen](/local_ha_energy_planner)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}